#10600
West Cliff Wall in the Flatlands Basin~
   Green grass and sand mix underfoot here, making travel tough going.
Heat rises from the flats, and sweat pours down your brow; the few
breezes that pass only blow hot air in your face.  To the west a sheer
cliff towers high above.  The red desert lies to the north, the basin to
the east, and the cliff runs on to the south.
~
