#10601
The Flatlands Basin~
   The flatlands stretch out to the east and south for a long way.
Close by to the west stands a huge cliff whose face could not be climbed
by anything without hooks for legs, and more cliffs rise far off to the
south and east.  To the north a vast desert of twisting red sand opens
before you.  The long, dry grass whispers in the hot wind.
