#10602
The Flatlands Basin~
   Long, dry grass grows from the red sand of this vast basin, whipping
about your ankles in the searing wind.  The heat rises from the flats in
shimmering waves, and sweat pours down your brow; the rare breeze only
blows more hot air in your face.  Towering cliffs ring the basin on
every side but the north, where a red desert begins.  The basin
stretches in every direction, with the desert to the north.
